WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.700
Question one!

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.500
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.033
Apple...

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:12.600
banana...

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:13.167
carrot...

00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:13.700
grape.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:14.267
A,

00:00:14.267 --> 00:00:14.833
apple...

00:00:14.833 --> 00:00:15.367
B,

00:00:15.367 --> 00:00:15.933
banana...

00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:16.500
C,

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.033
carrot...

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:18.133
or D,

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:18.700
grape?

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.367
Five seconds, go!

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:27.300
TIME'S UP!

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.400
Pencils down!

00:00:29.067 --> 00:00:30.300
The answer is...

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:30.700
C,

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:31.100
carrot!

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:31.933
An apple,

00:00:31.933 --> 00:00:32.333
banana,

00:00:32.333 --> 00:00:34.400
and grape are all fruits.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.433
A carrot is a vegetable,

00:00:36.433 --> 00:00:38.500
so it does not belong.

00:00:39.633 --> 00:00:40.633
Question three,

00:00:40.633 --> 00:00:42.100
a picture puzzle!

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:45.067
An empty circle becomes a filled-in

00:00:45.067 --> 00:00:45.533
circle.

00:00:45.533 --> 00:00:48.000
So an empty triangle becomes...

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.000
which one?

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:49.500
A,

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:50.967
a filled circle...

00:00:50.967 --> 00:00:51.467
B,

00:00:51.467 --> 00:00:52.933
an empty triangle...

00:00:52.933 --> 00:00:53.433
C,

00:00:53.433 --> 00:00:54.900
a filled square...

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:55.900
or D,

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:57.367
a filled triangle?

00:00:57.367 --> 00:00:58.333
Five seconds!

00:01:04.133 --> 00:01:05.267
TIME'S UP!

00:01:05.267 --> 00:01:06.367
Pencils down!

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:08.267
The answer is...

00:01:08.267 --> 00:01:08.700
D,

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:09.933
a filled triangle!

00:01:09.933 --> 00:01:12.400
The rule is the shape gets

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:14.867
filled in but stays the same

00:01:14.867 --> 00:01:15.300
shape,

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:17.767
so the empty triangle becomes a

00:01:17.767 --> 00:01:18.600
filled triangle.

00:01:19.733 --> 00:01:20.867
Question seven,

00:01:20.867 --> 00:01:22.533
a number series!

00:01:22.533 --> 00:01:23.100
One,

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:23.633
two,

00:01:23.633 --> 00:01:24.200
five,

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:24.767
ten,

00:01:24.767 --> 00:01:25.333
seventeen,

00:01:25.333 --> 00:01:26.433
and then...

00:01:26.433 --> 00:01:28.133
what comes next?

00:01:28.133 --> 00:01:28.667
A,

00:01:28.667 --> 00:01:29.233
twenty-four...

00:01:29.233 --> 00:01:29.800
B,

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:30.367
twenty-six...

00:01:30.367 --> 00:01:30.900
C,

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:31.467
twenty-five...

00:01:31.467 --> 00:01:32.600
or D,

00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:33.167
twenty-eight?

00:01:33.167 --> 00:01:34.267
Five seconds!

00:01:40.067 --> 00:01:41.200
TIME'S UP!

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.300
Pencils down!

00:01:42.967 --> 00:01:44.500
The answer is...

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:45.033
B,

00:01:45.033 --> 00:01:45.533
twenty-six!

00:01:45.533 --> 00:01:48.600
The gaps are the odd numbers

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:49.133
one,

00:01:49.133 --> 00:01:49.633
three,

00:01:49.633 --> 00:01:50.133
five,

00:01:50.133 --> 00:01:50.667
seven,

00:01:50.667 --> 00:01:51.700
then nine.

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:54.767
So seventeen plus nine is twenty-six.

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:56.300
So,

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:58.333
are you smart or fart?

00:01:58.333 --> 00:02:00.767
Count up your correct answers to

00:02:00.767 --> 00:02:01.967
find your rank!

00:02:03.133 --> 00:02:03.467
So,

00:02:03.467 --> 00:02:04.867
how did you do?

00:02:04.867 --> 00:02:06.233
Comment your score below,

00:02:06.233 --> 00:02:07.600
and follow for more!
